<section class="screen" id="emptyPeople"><div class="page" style="display:grid;place-items:center;height:100%;text-align:center"><div><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><h1 class="headline" style="margin-top:28px">That's everyone for today.</h1><p class="sub">A smaller set keeps discovery intentional. Come back tomorrow for new crossings.</p><button class="cta wide" onclick="nav('discover')">Back to discovery</button></div></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="emptyChats"><div class="page" style="display:grid;place-items:center;height:100%;text-align:center"><div><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><h1 class="headline" style="margin-top:28px">No conversations yet.</h1><p class="sub">When interest goes both ways, the conversation starts here.</p><button class="cta wide" onclick="nav('discover')">Discover people</button></div></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="loading"><div class="page" style="display:grid;place-items:center;height:100%;text-align:center"><div><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><p class="sub" style="margin-top:20px">Finding today's crossings...</p></div></div></section>
<section class="screen" id="error"><div class="page" style="display:grid;place-items:center;height:100%;text-align:center"><div><div class="brand">MINUKIMI</div><h1 class="headline" style="margin-top:28px">Something slipped.</h1><p class="sub">Your profile is safe on this device. Try again.</p><button class="cta wide" onclick="location.reload()">Try again</button></div></div></section>
<div class="modal" id="matchModal"><div class="match-card"><div style="height:120px;display:grid;place-items:center"><svg viewBox="0 0 292 100" style="width:100%;max-width:310px"><defs><linearGradient id="mgl"><stop stop-color="#ff3f9f"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#8f52ff"/></linearGradient><linearGradient id="mgr"><stop stop-color="#6e63ff"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#4fe6dc"/></linearGradient></defs><path d="M17 58 C41 88 77 89 108 73 C123 65 138 64 146 77 C130 63 118 53 114 41 C110 28 117 19 128 18 C136 17 143 21 146 27" fill="none" stroke="url(#mgl)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M146 27 C149 21 156 17 164 18 C175 19 182 28 178 41 C174 53 162 63 146 77 C154 64 169 65 184 73 C215 89 251 88 275 58" fill="none" stroke="url(#mgr)" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><div class="brand" style="margin-bottom:12px">MINUKIMI</div><h2>You found each other.</h2><p><span id="matchName">Maya</span> connected with you too.</p><div class="match-actions"><button class="cta" onclick="closeMatch(false);openChat()">Say hi</button><button class="secondary" onclick="closeMatch(true)">Keep browsing</button></div></div></div>
<div class="modal" id="safetyModal"><div class="stop-card"><span class="k">KIMI · quick exit</span><h3>End this connection?</h3><p>KIMI is never sent to the other person. You can end quietly, or end and report.</p><div class="stop-grid"><button class="cta danger" onclick="endConnection(false)">End chat</button><button class="secondary" onclick="endConnection(true)">End & report</button><button class="secondary" onclick="closeSafety()">Cancel</button></div></div></div>
</main></div><script src="app.js"></script></body></html>
